{"id":"5462","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5462_main_steam-devils-in-steam-fog-evaporation-fog_hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图中可在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>看到小河水面<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蒸发雾</span>上升起的一些水汽暴涡旋。水汽暴是不同高度饱和空气缓慢旋转的小气柱，其直径小，轴向几乎垂直。当相对更暖的水体或饱和水面上方有冷空气时，便会形成水汽暴。水汽暴通常会伴随蒸发雾（蒸汽雾或北冰洋雾）。涡旋的直径约为1米，有数米高。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kristen Bobo","location":"美国，田纳西州，范比伦县，凯恩溪","latitude":"纬度: 35° 48' 42'' N","longitude":"经度: 85° 26' 29'' W","date":"05 September 2010 0806 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.3.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.3.5"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5461_main_steam-devil-rising-from-evaporation-fog-steam-fog_hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>小河水面<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蒸汽雾</span>上升起的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">水汽暴</span>。 </p>\n<p>水汽暴是小而缓慢旋转的饱和空气柱，高度不等，直径较小，轴向几乎垂直，相对更暖的水体或饱和水面上有冷空气时会形成水汽暴。水汽暴通常会伴随蒸发雾（蒸汽雾或北冰洋雾），直径通常约为1米，有几米高。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kristen Bobo","location":"美国，田纳西州，范比伦县，凯恩溪","latitude":"纬度: 35° 48' 42'' N","longitude":"经度: 85° 26' 29'' W","date":"05 September 2010 0807 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5511_main_steam-devil-and-steam-fog-arctic-sea-smoke_hydrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">水汽暴</span>呈涡旋状从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蒸汽雾或北冰洋雾</span>上升起，它形成于加拿大新不伦瑞克大马南岛西北海岸的海面。</p>\n<p>水汽暴是小而缓慢旋转的饱和空气柱，高度不等，直径较小，轴向几乎垂直，相对更暖的水体或饱和水面上有冷空气时会形成水汽暴。在本图中，气温大约为-14 °C，而芬迪湾的水温约为8 °C。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Eric Van Lochem","location":"加拿大，新不伦瑞克，大马南岛","latitude":"纬度: 44° 42' 47'' N","longitude":"经度: 66° 47' 46'' W","date":"09 January 2017 1330 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.5"}]}]}